      <abstract>
        <para>
          &sles4sap; is an enterprise-grade operating system built to improve, secure and automate
          &sap; environments such as &hana;, &netweaver; and &s4h;. It delivers an optimized
          platform for &sap; workloads, with built-in &ha;, automation, lifecycle management, live
          patching, &sap; landscape monitoring and configuration validation.
